uted-foreground text-xl leading-8\">Sua contribuição é fundamental para concluirmos a construção do centro e começarmos a transformar vidas. Cada tijolo conta, cada ajuda importa..</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col border-border border-r pr-4 last:border-r-0\"><p class=\"font-bold text-3xl text-foreground\">5</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Voluntários Ativos</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col border-border border-r pr-4 last:border-r-0\"><p class=\"font-bold text-3xl text-foreground\">2+</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Parcerias Ativas</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"-left-12 -translate-y-1/2 absolute top-1/2 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-secondary/30 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"-right-12 -translate-y-1/2 absolute top-1/2 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-primary/30 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"z-10 max-w-md overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-2xl\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video w-full\"><img alt=\"Impacto na comunidade\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/_next/static/media/proj_habitacao.0nbxss4w5j~3p.jpeg\"/></div><div class=\"p-8\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl\">Como Você Pode Ajudar</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-muted-foreground\">Escolha a forma que mais combina com você e faça parte desta transformação social.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex gap-4\"><div class=\"flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wallet size-6 text-primary\"><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0